<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS6" title="In Appendix A A Brief Theoretical Derivation of Babai Rounding’s Error Bound ‣ Learning Grouped Lattice Vector Quantizers for Low-Bit LLM Compression" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.6 </span>LLL-Reduced Basis Case</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS7" title="In Appendix A A Brief Theoretical Derivation of Babai Rounding’s Error Bound ‣ Learning Grouped Lattice Vector Quantizers for Low-Bit LLM Compression" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.7 </span>Final Error Bound</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A2" title="In Learning Grouped Lattice Vector Quantizers for Low-Bit LLM Compression" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B </span>Storage Overhead Analysis</span></a>
